    "https://uni.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/UNI/job/Main-Campus/Construction-Project-Manager_JR985": {
      "title": "Construction Project Manager",
      "description": "Posted: 2026-10-27\nFull time\n\nIf you are a current University of Northern Iowa employee and would like to apply for this position, login to UNI Works and type “Find Jobs” in the search bar to view and apply for open positions. Full Consideration Date: 11/22/2026 Job Description: Summary: Serves as the University’s on-site representative for construction projects, overseeing all phases of project execution to ensure compliance with contract documents, quality standards, schedules and budgets; acts as the primary liaison among contractors, consultants, vendors, and University stakeholders, coordinating activities, monitoring progress, resolving construction issues, reviewing pay requests, and facilitating project completion; collaborates with design professionals and University representatives to manage change orders, interpret construction documents, address design concerns, and maintain comprehensive project records; provides cost estimates for budgeting purposes, prepares detailed construction reports, reviews plans for constructability and design improvements, and coordinates University-furnished equipment and materials; and conducts facility inspections, recommends repairs and improvements, and delivers high-quality customer service while supporting the successful delivery of campus construction and renovation projects. Required Minimum Qualifications: Bachelor's degree plus at least one year of experience in construction management or facilities management required. An associate’s degree plus at least three years of related experience may be substituted. Student experience will be considered. Fall 2026 graduates will be considered. Degree must be conferred prior to start date. Preferred Qualifications: Experience estimating, scheduling, supervising, and/or managing construction projects or multi-building facilities preferred. Position Details: Job Category: Professional and Scientific Type of Position: Regular Service Schedule: Calendar 